---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import homeDark from '../../assets/home-dark.png';
---

<p>
    <Image
        src={homeDark}
        alt="home page dark mode"
        style="float: right; margin: 0 0 1em 2em; width: 300px; max-width: 40vw; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);"
    />
    This screenshot shows the home page of the app in dark mode. The app is designed to be simple and intuitive to use, with a focus on providing useful information
    about fossils and geology. You can explore different locations, view fossil records, and learn about the geological history of different areas. The app is still
    in development, so there may be some bugs and missing features, but I'm working hard to make it as useful and enjoyable as possible.
</p>
<p>
    In this image you can see the main features of the home page, including the search bar at the top where you can enter a location to explore, and the various
    sections below that provide information about fossils, geology, and other related topics. You can click on different sections to learn more about specific
    topics, and there are also links to other pages where you can find more detailed information and resources.
</p>
